Z||000007||Pontiaddict||08-29-2001||11:59 PM||||Most of the zip files come with 2 or 3 files inside. one is called Car.viv, you put this in the C:\Program Files\Electronic Arts\Need For Speed III\GameData\CarModel\ directory you have to make a new folder for each car in this directory and give it a 4 letter name like "88gt"  there is sometimes a .qfs file also and that goes in the C:\Program Files\Electronic Arts\Need For Speed III\FeData\art\slides\ directory and it doesn't need a new folder made for it. you can put the readme.txt files anywhere on your computer and they will usually tell you where to put the other files too.||||reg||1
